{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2022-11-15 09:00:00', 'title': "GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT AND LINCOLN HARRIS PURCHASE 445,000-SQUARE-FOOT LIFE SCIENCE CAMPUS IN THE HEART OF RALEIGH-DURHAM'S RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK REGION", 'text': "DURHAM, N.C. , NOV. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A FUND MANAGED BY THE REAL ESTATE BUSINESS WITHIN GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT (GOLDMAN SACHS) AND NORTH CAROLINA REAL ESTATE FIRM LINCOLN HARRIS IS ACQUIRING A FIVE-BUILDING LIFE SCIENCE CAMPUS THAT'S PART OF TRIANGLE BUSINESS CENTER, SET IN THE HEART OF ONE OF THE NATION'S FASTING-GROWING LIFE SCIENCE REGIONS."}